 app implies acceptance of the revised terms.\n8. Governing Law\nThese Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan.\n\n9. Contact Us\nIf you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us using our Gmail: contact@example.invalid\n",
