.\nRequest the removal of your personal data from our systems.\nContact us for any questions or concerns regarding your data.\n8. Updates to the Privacy Policy\nWe may update this Privacy Policy occasionally to reflect changes in our services or legal requirements. Any updates will be posted within the app, and continued use of the app means acceptance of the updated policy.\n9. Contact UsIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us using our Gmail: contact@example.invalid\n",
